s=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">origin</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>E</mi><mtext>embedded</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E_{\\text{embedded}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">embedded</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为隐含排放，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>ETS</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_{\\text{ETS}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">ETS</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为 EU ETS 碳价，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>origin</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_{\\text{origin}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">origin</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为原产国已付碳价（可抵扣部分）。这条公式说明为什么&quot;只管税率表&quot;的做法会失败——<strong>税率只是税负的一个加数</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"工程建模-trq-数据模型与费率引擎\">工程建模：TRQ 数据模型与费率引擎</h2><p>把上述制度落成系统，核心是一张<strong>配额实体表</strong>加一个<strong>分段费率引擎</strong>。配额实体至少承载：配额序号、法域、商品范围（HS 编码区间）、供应国条件、配额期起止、总量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span></span></span></span></span>、已用量、状态（开放/临界/封锁）、管理方法与数据来源版本。费率引擎按&quot;归类 → 匹配配额 → 检查余额 → 分段计税&quot;的顺序执行，每一步都可回溯到具体的公告或税则版本。</p>\n<p>三条建模纪律值得单独写出。第一，<strong>配额余额与税率判断必须分离</strong>：余额是易变的共享状态，税率是相对稳定的规则数据，把二者写进同一张表会让每次额度扣减都触发全量规则重算。第二，<strong>保留规则版本与来源引用</strong>：TRQ 的税率与配额条件会因公告、贸易协定、临时措施而变化，计税结果必须能回答&quot;当时依据的是哪一版&quot;。第三，<strong>临界状态要前置预警</strong>：在占用率达到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>θ</mi><mtext>critical</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta_{\\text{critical}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">critical</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 时就发出告警，让企业有机会改用替代口岸或延后清关，而不是在封锁后被动接受高税率。</p>\n<p>TRQ 的本质是一道<strong>用税率表达的数量闸门</strong>：它在法律上兑现了&quot;最低准入&quot;的承诺，在工程上则把一个静态税率表变成了随配额余额动态变化的分段函数。跨境系统不应把它当成&quot;税率表里的一行&quot;，而应把它当成一个需要并发控制、版本管理与前置预警的状态机。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>TRQ 是<strong>两档税率 + 一道数量闸门</strong>：配额内低税、配额外高税，闸门由配额期可用额度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span></span></span></span></span> 控制；</li>\n<li>法律来源是《农业协定》关税化与最低准入承诺（1995 年达消费量 3%、发达成员 2000 年达 5%）；</li>\n<li>管理方法有先到先得、许可分配、历史业绩、国别分配、拍卖五类，直接决定抢额度策略；</li>\n<li>清关系统靠<strong>配额序号/类目码 + 临界/封锁状态</strong>落地，未携带有效配额标识即按配额外税率计税；</li>\n<li>2026 年税负 = 基准税 + 附加税（232/301）+ 碳成本（CBAM 确定期自 2026-01-01 起）三条数据链的汇合；</li>\n<li>工程三条纪律：余额与税率分离、保留规则版本与来源引用、临界状态前置预警。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"关税配额（TRQ）制度与配额内外的税率治理模型","id":"关税配额-trq-制度与配额内外的税率治理模型"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：TRQ 的两档税率构造与法律来源","id":"核心概念-trq-的两档税率构造与法律来源"},{"level":2,"text":"配额管理与分配：五种方法及其可争议点","id":"配额管理与分配-五种方法及其可争议点"},{"level":2,"text":"清关系统中的表示：配额序号与配额内税率的适用","id":"清关系统中的表示-配额序号与配额内税率的适用"},{"level":2,"text":"配额用尽与临界状态：超配额自动转档的治理","id":"配额用尽与临界状态-超配额自动转档的治理"},{"level":2,"text":"贸易管制证照与 TRQ 的耦合：2026 年的现实","id":"贸易管制证照与-trq-的耦合-2026-年的现实"},{"level":2,"text":"工程建模：TRQ 数据模型与费率引擎","id":"工程建模-trq-数据模型与费率引擎"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"进出口许可与贸易管制证照体系分类模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/tariff-quota-import-license-management/tariff-quota-license-regime-model/import-export-license-permit-taxonomy"}}